terraform.dev-202601012012.49.functions.7

test(terraform/functions): change hash test to plan command

The hash_test was using `command = apply` which actually modifies
infrastructure state, but this test only validates the output of
the `filesha256` function. Tests that merely verify computed values
don't require applying changes to infrastructure.

Changed to `command = plan` which evaluates functions and variables
without side effects. This makes the test faster and safer to run
in CI environments where apply operations could be restricted or
require additional permissions.

Also fixes typo in README.md where "edge cases" was corrupted to
"edge ses".

